1
00:00:00,818 --> 00:00:02,578
No!

2
00:00:02,787 --> 00:00:05,847
(Sheldon:)The word is Polish.
See? Look.

3
00:00:06,023 --> 00:00:07,823
Polish sausage!

4
00:00:07,992 --> 00:00:11,082
(Sheldon:)Model of the solar system,
developed by Nicolaus Copernicus...

5
00:00:11,262 --> 00:00:15,492
...a Polish astronomer. Finally, if that
wasn't enough, which it should've been...

6
00:00:15,666 --> 00:00:18,996
(Sheldon:)...this is Madame Curie killing herself
by discovering radium.

7
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:24,540
(Sheldon:)Who, although she was a naturalized
French citizen, was Polish by birth!

8
00:00:27,778 --> 00:00:30,038
(Penny:)Excuse me, the word is polish.

9
00:00:30,247 --> 00:00:31,947
(Penny:)See? Small P.

10
00:00:34,185 --> 00:00:35,615
(Sheldon:)Ah.

11
00:00:37,388 --> 00:00:41,048
(Sheldon:)So it is.
I guess we both share blame on this one.

12
00:00:44,862 --> 00:00:46,622
(Howard:)Bernie, you okay?

13
00:00:46,831 --> 00:00:48,561
(Bernadette(off):)Yeah, I'll be right there.

14
00:00:54,705 --> 00:01:00,025
(Howard:)Did you get a sea lion while I was gone?

